      "content": "rebuilding? there's nothing left to rebuild. they've already stripped everything away. the person everyone knew, the career, the reputation... it's all gone. it's like I'm a ghost walking around in a body that doesn't belong to me anymore. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a human, just this... wreckage. it's just gone.",
